    "Retain source bound, q divisor, predicted rounded post-bound, and measured post-bound for every production Rescale, including all PS and S2C factors.",
    "Confirm the 3->2 and 2->1 same-lift contraction checkpoints against the target branch's actual ciphertext rows."
  ],
  "conclusion": "Existing P93 capacity observations are comfortably below q012/q01 limits in recorded checkpoints, and the q0=56 public control passes; nevertheless those stage observations are from older fast-ckks provenance, while one required current-branch C2S pre-Rescale bound is missing. This is not evidence of failure; it is insufficient evidence to claim full-profile capacity proven."
